{"title":"UK fact of the day","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925594031/0/marginalrevolution~UK-fact-of-the-day.html","date":1759255240000,"content":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>London has slipped out of the world’s top 20 initial public offering markets as the third quarter ends, overtaken by Mexico and Singapore in a fresh blow to its standing as a global finance hub.</p>\r\n<p>The UK exchange has slipped three places to 23rd in a Bloomberg ranking of the world’s busiest IPO destinations, placing it behind the frontier market of Oman. Volume this year dropped 69% to $248 million, the weakest haul in more than 35 years.</p>\r\n<p>This year’s <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-07-21/london-s-biggest-2025-ipo-rallies-33-after-braving-tariff-storm\" target=\"_blank\">largest</a> London IPO — an April offering from accountancy <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/quote/MHA:LN\" target=\"_blank\">MHA Plc</a> — raised £98 million ($132 million). No deals have involved a major Wall Street bank; they were instead arranged by small local outfits like <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/quote/CAV:LN\" target=\"_blank\">Cavendish Plc</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/quote/0618485D:LN\" target=\"_blank\">Singer Capital Markets</a>. The third-quarter picture is even starker with just $42 million of deal volume, down 85% from the same period last year, according to data compiled by Bloomberg.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-09-30/london-drops-out-of-top-20-ipo-markets-after-69-plunge-in-fundraising?taid=68dbc4722712010001907b84&amp;utm_campaign=trueanthem&amp;utm_content=business&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=twitter&amp;sref=htOHjx5Y\" target=\"_blank\">more from Bloomberg</a>.  Once your status as a financial center unravels…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/uk-fact-of-the-day-7.html\">UK fact of the day</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925594031/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925594031/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/925594031/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/925594031/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/925594031/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/925594031/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/uk-fact-of-the-day-7.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/uk-fact-of-the-day-7.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/uk-fact-of-the-day-7.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/uk-fact-of-the-day-7.html#comment-160969425\">In reply to Bob.   There never was a pro-growth r